{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>It is exalted. The adversaries of Rezin.</b> They are Assyria:" "<b>His adversaries.</b> Those who turn back to HaShem, and they are Aram or Israel:"], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {0 "Ibn Ezra quotes the Hebrew phrase צרי רצין as it appears in the verse (Isaiah 9:10 in some traditions; 9:11 in others); rendered literally as 'the adversaries of Rezin.'"}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:53:00.111846469Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}